---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Byte Symphony - Development & Analytics | Taiwo Heard" description="AI-powered analytics tools for content creators. Dreamy chatbot interprets YouTube metrics in plain English. Interactive Bayesian statistics learning platform.">
    <style slot="head">
        /* Page-specific styles */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(107, 255, 184, 0.1), transparent 60%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(126, 196, 255, 0.1), transparent 40%);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-svg-waves {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
            width: 130%;
            height: 180px;
            z-index: 2;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
        .hero-svg-waves svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: block;
        }
        @keyframes waveMove {
            0% { transform: translateX(0); }
            100% { transform: translateX(-60px); }
        }
        .hero-svg-waves .wave1 {
            animation: waveMove 8s linear infinite alternate;
        }
        .hero-svg-waves .wave2 {
            animation: waveMove 12s linear infinite alternate-reverse;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #888);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero h1 .playful {
            font-family: var(--font-playful);
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-tertiary), var(--accent-playful), var(--accent-playful2));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
        }

        .scroll-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 40px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            opacity: 0.5;
            z-index: 4;
        }

        .intro-section {
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .intro-content {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .intro-text {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 400;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .intro-section {
                padding: 2rem 1rem;
            }
            .intro-text {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
        }

        .main-grid {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2.5rem;
            justify-items: center;
            align-items: start;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .main-grid {
                padding: 2rem 1rem;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 12vw, 4rem);
            }
            .project-card {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            .project-title {
                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 8vw, 2.2rem);
                line-height: 1.1;
            }
            .project-desc {
                font-size: 0.95rem;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }
            .project-meta {
                font-size: 0.8rem;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }
            .badge {
                font-size: 0.65rem;
                padding: 3px 10px;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }
            .project-links {
                gap: 1rem;
            }
            .project-link {
                font-size: 0.8rem;
            }
            .project-icon-wrapper {
                height: 120px;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }
            .project-icon-wrapper svg {
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
            }
            .section-header h2 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .project-card.featured {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        .project-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-self: start;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .project-card.featured {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.8fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: start;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .project-card.featured {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            background: var(--gradient-main);
            color: #000;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .project-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .project-meta {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--accent-tertiary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Ensure bottom elements align */
        .project-card > .project-meta:last-child,
        .project-card > .project-link:last-child,
        .project-card > .project-links:last-child {
            margin-top: auto;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .project-desc {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .project-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        .project-link {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--accent-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .project-link:hover {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .project-link::after {
            content: '→';
        }

        .dreamy-images {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .dreamy-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            object-fit: cover;
            cursor: zoom-in;
        }

        .dreamy-img:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .lightbox {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.85);
            z-index: 10000;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 4rem;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            cursor: zoom-out;
        }

        .lightbox.active {
            display: flex;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .lightbox-content {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 85%;
            max-height: 85%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 10001;
            cursor: default;
        }

        .lightbox-img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 85vh;
            width: auto;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            object-fit: contain;
            animation: lightboxZoom 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
        }

        @keyframes lightboxZoom {
            from { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .lightbox-close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            color: #fff;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 10002;
        }

        .lightbox-close:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transform: rotate(90deg) scale(1.1);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .lightbox {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            .lightbox-content {
                max-width: 95%;
                max-height: 90%;
            }
            .lightbox-img {
                max-width: 100%;
                max-height: 80vh;
                border-radius: 12px;
            }
            .lightbox-close {
                top: 15px;
                right: 15px;
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .dreamy-images {
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        .project-icon-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            height: 150px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .project-icon-wrapper svg {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .biographer-icon { color: var(--accent-playful2); }
        .biographer-icon::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--accent-playful2), transparent 70%);
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        .octopus-icon { color: var(--accent-tertiary); }
        .octopus-icon::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--accent-tertiary), transparent 70%);
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        .mixa-icon { color: var(--accent-primary); }
        .mixa-icon::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--accent-primary), transparent 70%);
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        .section-header {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 4rem auto 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            font-weight: 300;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .expandable-card {
            cursor: default;
        }

        .expandable-card.collapsed .expandable-content {
            display: none;
        }

        .expandable-card.expanded .expandable-content {
            display: block;
            animation: expandContent 0.4s ease-out;
        }

        .expand-toggle {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            margin-top: auto;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--accent-primary);
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .expand-toggle:hover {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .expand-arrow {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .expandable-card.expanded .expand-arrow {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
            margin-top: 3.5rem;
        }

        .expandable-card.expanded .expand-text {
            display: none;
        }

        @keyframes expandContent {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-10px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .animate {
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>

    <!-- Lightbox Modal -->
    <div class="lightbox" id="lightbox">
        <button class="lightbox-close" id="lightboxClose" aria-label="Close lightbox">×</button>
        <div class="lightbox-content">
            <img class="lightbox-img" id="lightboxImg" src="" alt="Expanded view">
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-bg"></div>
        <div class="hero-svg-waves">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 2000 180" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                <path class="wave1" d="M0,120 Q360,180 720,120 T1440,120 T2000,120 V180 H0 Z" fill="#7ec4ff" fill-opacity="0.18"/>
                <path class="wave2" d="M0,140 C200,140 400,100 600,140 C800,180 1000,100 1200,140 C1400,180 1600,100 1800,140 C1900,160 1950,150 2000,140 V180 H0 Z" fill="#ffb3ec" fill-opacity="0.13"/>
                <path d="M0,160 Q360,100 720,160 T1440,160 T2000,160 V180 H0 Z" fill="#ffd93d" fill-opacity="0.10"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1 class="animate">Byte <span class="playful">Symphony</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                A collection of tools, experiments, and data-driven projects that explore the intersection of creative technology and human insights.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-indicator">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M7 13l5 5 5-5M7 6l5 5 5-5"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro Section -->
    <section class="intro-section animate" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <div class="intro-content">
            <p class="intro-text">
                Where AI meets audio intelligence. These projects represent Taiwo Heard's R&D side—tools built to solve real problems, experiments that push technical boundaries, and data-driven explorations that reveal hidden patterns. From YouTube analytics to Bayesian statistics education, each project demonstrates what happens when you combine a problem-solving mindset with creative curiosity.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Featured Project</h2>
    </div>

    <main class="main-grid">
        <!-- Dreamy -->
        <div class="project-card featured animate" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
            <div class="dreamy-images">
                <img src="/sounds-and-bytes/images/Screen Shot 2025-12-21 at 9.53.44 AM.png" alt="Dreamy Screenshot 1" class="dreamy-img">
                <img src="/sounds-and-bytes/images/Screen Shot 2025-12-21 at 9.59.21 AM.png" alt="Dreamy Screenshot 2" class="dreamy-img">
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="badge">AI Analytics</div>
                <h2 class="project-title">DREAMY</h2>
                <div class="project-meta">Python • LangChain • Supabase • YouTube Data API v3</div>
                <p class="project-desc">
                    Data is only as good as its delivery. DREAMY is a specialized analytics intelligence platform built for YouTube creators who need more than static dashboards—they need a consultant that actually understands their channel.
                </p>
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                    Here's how it works under the hood: The engine authenticates via OAuth2 to pull video metadata and deep-performance analytics directly from YouTube's APIs. A custom Pandas pipeline then classifies content into Shorts vs. Long-form, calculates niche-specific metrics like "Watch Time per View," and normalizes time zones to align posting times with actual viewer peak-activity hours.
                </p>
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                    The real magic is the AI "Consultant": At the heart of DREAMY is a Hybrid RAG architecture I built from scratch—no black-box external services. It combines TF-IDF with Cosine Similarity for semantic relevance, BM25 for precise keyword matching, and metadata filtering that lets the bot query its own knowledge base before processing your question.
                </p>
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                    The result? Ask natural questions like "Why did my views drop last month?" or "Which videos should I promote?" and get contextual answers grounded in your actual channel data—with significantly reduced hallucinations.
                </p>
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
                    <strong>Status:</strong> Live Demo Available
                </p>
                <div class="project-links">
                    <a href="/sounds-and-bytes/contact" class="project-link">Request DREAMY access</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-top: 2rem;">
            <h2>Development & Data Tools</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- Sweetspot -->
        <a href="/sounds-and-bytes/sweetspot" class="project-card animate" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
            <div class="badge">Audio Tech</div>
            <h2 class="project-title">Sweetspot</h2>
            <div class="project-meta">Python • PyQt5 • NumPy</div>
            <p class="project-desc">
                Real-time microphone distance trainer using audio level analysis and visual color feedback. Helps podcasters and vocalists build muscle memory for optimal mic technique.
            </p>
            <div class="project-link">View Project</div>
        </a>

        <!-- BayesQuest -->
        <div class="project-card animate" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
            <div class="badge">Teaching Tool</div>
            <h2 class="project-title">BayesQuest</h2>
            <div class="project-meta">JavaScript • Educational Design</div>
            <p class="project-desc">
                Interactive teaching tool designed to demystify Bayesian statistics through gamified exploration. Historical intuition replaces abstract formulas, making probability theory accessible to students and non-mathematicians.
            </p>
            <div class="project-links">
                <a href="https://taiheard.github.io/BayesQuest/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Live Tool</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/taiheard/BayesQuest" target="_blank" class="project-link">GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Cognate Analysis -->
        <a href="https://taiheard.github.io/english-spanish-cognate-analysis-site/index.html" target="_blank" class="project-card animate" style="animation-delay: 0.7s;">
            <div class="badge">Data Analysis</div>
            <h2 class="project-title">Cognate Analysis</h2>
            <div class="project-meta">NLP • Linguistics • Data Vis</div>
            <p class="project-desc">
                A deep dive into linguistic overlaps between English and Spanish. Analyzes cognates to uncover patterns in language evolution and accelerate exploration through data visualization.
            </p>
            <div class="project-link">Explore Data</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Music for the People -->
        <div class="project-card expandable-card collapsed animate" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;" data-card="music-people">
            <div class="badge">Interactive Experience</div>
            <h2 class="project-title">Music for the People</h2>
            <div class="project-meta">Vanilla JS • CSS Grid • Audio API</div>
            <p class="project-desc">
                A morphing audio-visual playground built to demonstrate advanced front-end architecture in service of emotional impact.
            </p>

            <div class="expandable-content">
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                    <strong>Technical Highlights:</strong>
                </p>
                <ul style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1rem;">
                    <li><strong>Dynamic CSS Theming</strong> — Real-time variable swapping across three distinct visual modes (Chill, Dance, Strange) with smooth 0.8s cubic-bezier transitions</li>
                    <li><strong>State Management</strong> — Persistent mode selection via localStorage, playlist shuffling, and cross-component synchronization without external libraries</li>
                    <li><strong>Audio API Integration</strong> — Custom HTML5 audio player with progress tracking, autoplay detection, and smart resource allocation (pausing background videos during YouTube playback)</li>
                    <li><strong>Performance Optimization</strong> — Lazy-loaded thumbnails with quality fallbacks, reduced motion support, and intelligent video relay system</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/sounds-and-bytes/music-for-the-people" class="project-link">Experience It Live →</a>
            </div>

            <button class="expand-toggle" aria-label="Toggle card details">
                <span class="expand-text">See more</span>
                <svg class="expand-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Flow States -->
        <div class="project-card expandable-card collapsed animate" style="animation-delay: 1.0s;" data-card="flow-states">
            <div class="badge">Interactive Narrative</div>
            <h2 class="project-title">Flow States</h2>
            <div class="project-meta">Astro • Vanilla JS</div>
            <p class="project-desc">
                An experiment in scroll-based storytelling that explores how pacing, media, and interaction design can work together on the web. The content is meditative—breathing exercises, ambient video loops, gentle storytelling.
            </p>

            <div class="expandable-content">
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                    <strong>Technical Highlights:</strong>
                </p>
                <ul style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1rem;">
                    <li><strong>Scroll-Triggered Reveals:</strong> IntersectionObserver fires chapter animations as they enter the viewport—no scroll-jacking, just progressive disclosure</li>
                    <li><strong>Lazy Video Proxy:</strong> YouTube embeds load on-click via a custom proxy pattern—thumbnails load first, iframes only when requested</li>
                    <li><strong>Sticky Media Frames:</strong> CSS Grid + position: sticky keeps video anchored while text scrolls past on desktop</li>
                    <li><strong>Mouse-Driven Parallax:</strong> Layered star field responds to cursor position for subtle depth</li>
                    <li><strong>Accessibility Built In:</strong> Keyboard nav (arrow keys), prefers-reduced-motion support, ARIA labels on progress dots</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="project-desc" style="font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                    <strong>Built With:</strong> Astro • Vanilla JS • CSS Grid • IntersectionObserver • YouTube Embed API
                </p>
                <a href="/sounds-and-bytes/flow-states" class="project-link">View the Demo →</a>
            </div>

            <button class="expand-toggle" aria-label="Toggle card details">
                <span class="expand-text">See more</span>
                <svg class="expand-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>

